  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A rocket is launched from a space station and travels to Earth at constant speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. According to clocks on the rocket, the trip takes <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.5\"></span> days and according to clocks on both the space station and Earth the trip takes <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"7.0\"></span> days. The space station is stationary relative to Earth.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{c}\"></span>? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
